[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8524.79, "timestamp": "02:22:04", "text": "不，不要总是死。看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8528.15, "timestamp": "02:22:08", "text": "呃，不。不，不，不是。事情并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8533.83, "timestamp": "02:22:13", "text": "作品。民主具有保护作用。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8535.83, "timestamp": "02:22:15", "text": "反正，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8538.55, "timestamp": "02:22:18", "text": "那是颗健康炸弹吗？哦，不。为什么是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8541.59, "timestamp": "02:22:21", "text": "农业？这里面肯定有东西。出色地，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8544.469, "timestamp": "02:22:24", "text": "样本数量真不少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8546.23, "timestamp": "02:22:26", "text": "但现在并不是做这件事的好时机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8549.59, "timestamp": "02:22:29", "text": "样本。我不知道我为什么会在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8561.03, "timestamp": "02:22:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8563.75, "timestamp": "02:22:43", "text": "请求轨道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8573.429, "timestamp": "02:22:53", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8577.59, "timestamp": "02:22:57", "text": "你们干脆就别管我了。"}]